{"1356660": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starlit World", "steam_appid": 1356660, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4917950, 4918030], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/ede242e81da75c7a170af0eaad404aa1.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/ede242e81da75c7a170af0eaad404aa1.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/ede242e81da75c7a170af0eaad404aa1.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore Enchanting Worlds</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through unique landscapes and charming places, each with its own obstacles and challenges. Find hidden paths and discover something new in every world.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/92f08b3f4d20269d6742d0b0ed0a7626.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/92f08b3f4d20269d6742d0b0ed0a7626.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/92f08b3f4d20269d6742d0b0ed0a7626.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><u> </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Rescue the Starlits</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore during the day and survive the night. Run, jump, and fight enemies as you collect gems and grow stronger. Find the scattered Starlits and bring them safely back home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/b382fa70d704fb8c1b728cc6e18fe799.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/b382fa70d704fb8c1b728cc6e18fe799.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/b382fa70d704fb8c1b728cc6e18fe799.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fight Mighty Bosses</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a powerful boss at the end of each world. Learn their attacks, dodge at the right time, and break Oli’s spell to set them free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/770c59d9ac5f6db8cd4f94958ea8794e.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/770c59d9ac5f6db8cd4f94958ea8794e.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/770c59d9ac5f6db8cd4f94958ea8794e.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Discover Special Suits</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each suit offers unique powers and a different playstyle. Choose the one that best fits your style to explore, fight enemies, and overcome challenges your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/053b98a85a66f97a8097d6ef2e5dbd7f.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/053b98a85a66f97a8097d6ef2e5dbd7f.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/053b98a85a66f97a8097d6ef2e5dbd7f.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Rebuild Starlit Island</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring Starlit Island back to life with every Starlit you rescue. Explore new areas, meet its residents, and watch the island grow. Collect stickers, complete your album, and unlock rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/24683a9b59c452dfc14cc3d190303ce0.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/24683a9b59c452dfc14cc3d190303ce0.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/24683a9b59c452dfc14cc3d190303ce0.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/ede242e81da75c7a170af0eaad404aa1.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/ede242e81da75c7a170af0eaad404aa1.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/ede242e81da75c7a170af0eaad404aa1.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Explore Enchanting Worlds</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through unique landscapes and charming places, each with its own obstacles and challenges. Find hidden paths and discover something new in every world.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/92f08b3f4d20269d6742d0b0ed0a7626.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/92f08b3f4d20269d6742d0b0ed0a7626.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/92f08b3f4d20269d6742d0b0ed0a7626.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><u> </u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Rescue the Starlits</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore during the day and survive the night. Run, jump, and fight enemies as you collect gems and grow stronger. Find the scattered Starlits and bring them safely back home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/b382fa70d704fb8c1b728cc6e18fe799.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/b382fa70d704fb8c1b728cc6e18fe799.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/b382fa70d704fb8c1b728cc6e18fe799.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Fight Mighty Bosses</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a powerful boss at the end of each world. Learn their attacks, dodge at the right time, and break Oli’s spell to set them free.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/770c59d9ac5f6db8cd4f94958ea8794e.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/770c59d9ac5f6db8cd4f94958ea8794e.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/770c59d9ac5f6db8cd4f94958ea8794e.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Discover Special Suits</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each suit offers unique powers and a different playstyle. Choose the one that best fits your style to explore, fight enemies, and overcome challenges your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/053b98a85a66f97a8097d6ef2e5dbd7f.poster.avif?t=1786367302\" width=800 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/053b98a85a66f97a8097d6ef2e5dbd7f.webm?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1356660/extras/053b98a85a66f97a8097d6ef2e5dbd7f.mp4?t=1786367302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >